<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: An ultratech staff threaded with psychic focusing materials. While it is a solid melee weapon, its main purpose is to enhance the wielder's psychic sensitivity and neural heat dissipation, allowing more use of psychic powers.
\nThis weapon has an onboard persona that can bond to only a single person. The wielder and intelligent weapon can synchronize their reflexes and attack with frightening speed, accuracy, and creativity. Once bonded to a wielder, the weapon's persona will refuse to be wielded by anyone else.-->
  <VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.description>一名超技术人员使用灵能聚焦材料。虽然它是一种坚固的近战武器，但其主要目的是增强持有者的心灵敏感度和神经散热，从而允许更多地使用心灵力量。

该武器具有只能与一个人结合的板载角色。使用者和智能武器可以以惊人的速度、准确性和创造力同步反应和攻击。一旦与持有者结合，该武器的角色将拒绝被其他人持有。</VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.description>
  <!--EN: persona eltex staff-->
  <VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.label>角色 Eltex 员工</VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.label>
  <!--EN: head-->
  <VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.tools.0.label>头</VPWE_MeleeWeapon_PsyfocusStaffBladelink.tools.0.label>
